# VS Code example

Use with VS Code plus GitHub Copilot or other AI extensions.

## Suggested setup

- place `.github/copilot-instructions.md` in the project;
- add `AGENTS.md`, `PROJECT_MAP.md` and `README.md`;
- use `prompts/` and `templates/` as copyable building blocks;
- run the helper scripts from `scripts/` after changes.

## Rules

- prefer small diffs;
- do not activate deferred surfaces;
- ask before dependencies, migrations, auth or payments;
- report validation and changed files.
